;- API design only — no callable functions are implemented in this module yet.
  Proposed functions:
      sync.mutex()
      sync.lock(mutex)
      sync.unlock(mutex)
      sync.destroy(mutex)
      sync.condition()
      sync.wait(condition, mutex)
      sync.signal(condition)
      sync.broadcast(condition)

  Lock ownership, timeout rules, deadlock behavior, and thread-cancellation interaction
  must be decided before these primitives become part of a stable public API. -;
